eight=\"600\">","excerpt":".无言以对","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":23,"created":1597999572,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1280183672504168448"},{"id":"1277682196334596096","title":"关于最近的一些问题吧，拿几张图说明一下","content":"<p>关于最近的一些问题吧，拿几张图说明一下。</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-57f8b2b36196f88a8266c8a19d29106b_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1624\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-95dae01f52fc51faca2cda5bbdba72ee_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1624\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-247b68b5165097400d6d3e035e7a20d2_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1624\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-b05065745e7e07b6b4abd5a094c0bc48_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1624\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c02d1198c37f2c45d845f81c8e41932_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1624\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-c68e26981bc204f08afa1a447db73abc_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1624\" height=\"750\">","excerpt":"关于最近的一些问题吧，拿几张图说明一下","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":23,"created":1597403173,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1277682196334596096"},{"id":"1277680632915824640","title":"关于这一段大家看到夏粮收购同比下降剧烈…","content":"<p>关于这一段大家看到夏粮收购同比下降剧烈的消息我还是在这里再给大家做一点解释吧，新闻上往往会拿着农民惜售来说这个事。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;其实哪有农民真正惜售的啊，熟悉历史的都很清楚，每逢灾年下粮食短缺下真正受灾的从来不是那些不种地的老爷和市民，往往饿死的总是那些种粮种田的农民。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;是的，现实就是这么魔幻。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;每逢荒年，农民往往是最吃不起饭的，但偏偏他们又是种粮食的。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;哪有惜售，只是历史教训太惨重了。</p>","excerpt":"关于这一段大家看到夏粮收购同比下降剧烈…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":4,"created":1597402801,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1277680632915824640"},{"